<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 17870 0 R/Alt(Flow diagram. Top row: RTL feeds logic synthesis with Yosys, which writes the netlist. Middle row: the Liberty file feeds both logic synthesis and static timing analysis with OpenSTA. The netlist also feeds the static timing analysis, which writes an SDF file with the cell delays. The netlist and the SDF file enter the simulator, Icarus Verilog, from the left, the cocotb testbench from above, and the Verilog cell models of the PDK from below. The simulator produces pass or fail. A grey note below the SDF box says that after the layout, the SDF file also holds the wire delays.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[24]/Pg 31936 0 R>>
