20261 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 20262 0 R/Alt(Tree diagram. The root bistable element, in German bistabile Kippstufe, branches into unclocked, ungetaktet, and clocked, taktgesteuert. Unclocked leads to the SR latch of two cross-coupled gates. Clocked branches into level-sensitive, taktzustandsgesteuert, and edge-triggered, taktflankengesteuert. Level-sensitive leads to the D latch, cell dlhq_1, and edge-triggered leads to the D flip-flop, cell dfrbpq_1. The two latches are orange, the flip-flop is blue.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31971 0 R>>
endobj
