20427 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 20428 0 R/Alt(Timing diagram drawn to scale over a time axis from -0.4 to 0.4 ns, with a dashed line at the rising clock edge at 0. Below the row clk follow three groups, early, in window, and late, each with the rows RESET_B and Q. On every RESET_B row, a narrow shaded window lies between -0.133 and -0.114 ns. In the group early, RESET_B rises at -0.30 ns, and Q changes from 0 to 1 at 0.207 ns. In the group in window, RESET_B rises inside the shaded window, and Q is 0 until 0.207 ns and undefined, drawn hatched, afterwards. In the group late, RESET_B rises at -0.05 ns, and Q stays 0. Arrows below the rows mark t_rec = 0.133 ns from the start of the window to the edge, t_cq = 0.207 ns from the edge to the change of Q, and t_rem = -0.114 ns from the end of the window to the edge.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 31975 0 R>>
endobj
