<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 25640 0 R/Alt(Timing diagram over eleven clock periods with five rows: clk, scan_enable, scan_in, primary inputs and scan_out. scan_enable is high for four periods, low for one, high for four, low for one and high again. scan_in carries pattern 1 during the first four periods and pattern 2 during periods six to nine. The primary inputs carry in 1 in period five and in 2 in period ten. scan_out carries response 1 during periods six to nine. Labels above the diagram mark the phases shift, capture, shift and capture, and dashed lines mark the clock edges at the end of the two capture periods.)/A[<</O/Layout/Placement/Block>>]/K[0]/Pg 32043 0 R>>
endobj
